/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 50 0 R
/E (Round 2 of The Extreme Heat and Community Resilience Program will fund Early and Advanced Infrastructure projects to mitigate the impacts of extreme heat. Project proposals for Round 2 must demonstrate how they advance the Extreme Heat Program Values of Harm Reduction, Collaborative Partnerships, Belonging, and Lasting Community Benefits. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
