/P 50 0 R
/E (Projects that provide lasting community benefits create broader, long-term resources that extend beyond a single solution. Effective project design should drive lasting change by influencing policy, launching new programs, creating thoughtful planning for the future, and catalyzing future infrastructure investments. Consider the following questions to incorporate lasting community benefits into your project design: )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [9]
>>
